# Testing and validation

- Prefer deterministic tests over LLM judges.
- Unit: `npm test`. DB tests only with authorized test DB URLs.
- Do not claim tests/browser/prod readiness without executing verification.
- No real client data in fixtures.
- Policy boundary: no approved recommendations/ROI from evidence extraction paths in current phase.

See `EVALUATION_STANDARD.md` and existing vitest configs.
